- **Time-of-day background explains a quarter to a half of the band's advantage.** Twins placed in the band hours also reach TP more often than twins elsewhere, by 1.2 to 3.1 pp. The remaining difference of 2.2 to 3.4 pp has the same sign in all three windows but never reaches t of 2.
